  "description": "Ordered benchmark corpus covering Oracle, Nexus, Meta Conductor, Mission Control, Command Center, and Command Center Live. Cases are intentionally sequenced so later operator diagnostics can observe earlier runtime telemetry.",
  "classes": [
    "micro_utility",
